1
00:00:01,084 --> 00:00:02,377
<i>- Are you sick?</i>
<i>- Pa.</i>

2
00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:03,586
<i>I'm fine. Thank you.</i>

3
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:05,171
<i>- Sweetheart.</i>
<i>- Pa.</i>

4
00:00:05,255 --> 00:00:07,007
<i>- What happened?</i>
<i>- It's about Mama…</i>

5
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:08,258
<i>Well, where is she?</i>

6
00:00:08,341 --> 00:00:10,552
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

7
00:00:10,635 --> 00:00:17,475
[POLICE SIREN WAILING]

8
00:00:20,812 --> 00:00:22,021
[PRECIOUS] <i>Enrico?</i>

9
00:00:22,105 --> 00:00:24,149
[ENRICO] <i>Are you and Oliver home?</i>

10
00:00:24,232 --> 00:00:26,109
[PRECIOUS] <i>Yes, we're home.</i>

11
00:00:26,192 --> 00:00:27,861
<i>Why? Is there a problem?</i>

12
00:00:28,486 --> 00:00:31,031
[ENRICO] <i>Just be vigilant.</i>

13
00:00:31,114 --> 00:00:33,158
<i>Watch out for Mariela.</i>

14
00:00:33,241 --> 00:00:34,534
[PRECIOUS] <i>What?!</i>

15
00:00:34,617 --> 00:00:40,206
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

16
00:00:43,543 --> 00:00:44,878
<i>W-Who are you?</i>

17
00:00:46,087 --> 00:00:47,589
[OLIVER] <i>What do you need?</i>

18
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:53,261
<i>Where do you think you're going?</i>
<i>You're going to tell on me?</i>

19
00:00:54,054 --> 00:00:55,180
<i>Your old house burned down,</i>

20
00:00:55,263 --> 00:00:57,515
<i>yet you still have a nice place to live.</i>

21
00:00:57,599 --> 00:00:58,767
<i>- Isn't that so?</i>
<i>- Oliver!</i>

22
00:00:58,850 --> 00:01:00,810
<i>- Mariela, don't!</i>
<i>- And you!</i>

23
00:01:00,894 --> 00:01:02,270
<i>- Don't…</i>
<i>- You snake!</i>

24
00:01:02,353 --> 00:01:05,523
<i>Our lives are miserable because of you!</i>

25
00:01:07,692 --> 00:01:08,777
<i>Let's move!</i>

26
00:01:09,986 --> 00:01:10,904
[ENRICO] <i>Come on!</i>

27
00:01:12,989 --> 00:01:13,907
<i>Ma?</i>

28
00:01:13,990 --> 00:01:15,241
[BEA] <i>Ma?</i>

29
00:01:15,325 --> 00:01:17,118
<i>- Ma!</i>
<i>- Bea!</i>

30
00:01:17,202 --> 00:01:20,080
- [ENRICO]<i> Mariela!</i>
<i>- Ma, what are you doing? Ma!</i>

31
00:01:20,163 --> 00:01:22,415
<i>Get those two out</i>
<i>or I'm going to kill him!</i>

32
00:01:22,499 --> 00:01:23,917
<i>- Okay, okay.</i>
<i>- No, don't!</i>

33
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,418
<i>- Mariela!</i>
<i>- Hey!</i>

34
00:01:25,502 --> 00:01:28,421
<i>- Ma. Ma, wait. Listen to me.</i>
<i>- Mariela! Open the door!</i>

35
00:01:28,505 --> 00:01:30,381
<i>- Let Oliver go, Ma.</i>
<i>- You're on my side, right?</i>

36
00:01:30,465 --> 00:01:33,676
<i>Yes, I'm on your side,</i>
<i>but please let Oliver go.</i>

37
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:35,178
<i>Ma, I'm begging you.</i>

38
00:01:35,261 --> 00:01:38,014
<i>- Ma, Ma…</i>
<i>- Okay, I'll let him go.</i>

39
00:01:38,097 --> 00:01:39,349
<i>- Let him go--</i>
- [SCREAMING]

40
00:01:39,432 --> 00:01:40,767
- [FLESH RIPS]
- [EXCLAIMS]

41
00:01:40,850 --> 00:01:42,352
[BEA GROANS]

42
00:01:42,435 --> 00:01:43,770
[MARIELA] <i>Bea? Bea!</i>

43
00:01:44,479 --> 00:01:45,814
<i>Ugh!</i>

44
00:01:45,897 --> 00:01:49,275
[FURIOUS SCREAM]
<i>This is your fault, Oliver!</i>

45
00:01:50,151 --> 00:01:52,112
- [BEA] <i>No! Oliver!</i>
- [MARIELA SCREAMING]

46
00:01:53,029 --> 00:01:54,489
- [PRECIOUS] <i>Billy?</i>
- <i>Auntie!</i>

47
00:01:55,657 --> 00:01:57,283
<i>Mariela stabbed him.</i>

48
00:01:57,367 --> 00:01:59,577
<i>Let's go, let's go! Oliver?</i>

49
00:01:59,661 --> 00:02:00,495
[BILLY] <i>Oliver?</i>

50
00:02:00,578 --> 00:02:04,040
<i>Hold on, Oliver. Just hold on.</i>

51
00:02:04,124 --> 00:02:05,208
<i>Billy…</i>

52
00:02:05,291 --> 00:02:06,167
[PRECIOUS] <i>Oliver…</i>

53
00:02:06,251 --> 00:02:09,170
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

54
00:02:09,254 --> 00:02:14,717
[MUSIC BECOMES MOROSE]

55
00:02:26,688 --> 00:02:33,695
[THEME MUSIC PLAYING]

56
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:41,471
[PRECIOUS SNIFFLES]

57
00:03:45,350 --> 00:03:46,476
[PRECIOUS] Oh.

58
00:03:49,312 --> 00:03:51,439
We have stabilized Oliver.

59
00:03:52,023 --> 00:03:53,441
Operation was a success.

60
00:03:53,524 --> 00:03:54,901
He has been extubated,

61
00:03:54,984 --> 00:03:57,862
and we're slowly titrating oxygen support.

62
00:03:57,946 --> 00:04:01,366
But there's something you should know.

63
00:04:01,449 --> 00:04:04,702
The blood loss deprived
his brain of oxygen

64
00:04:04,786 --> 00:04:08,957
and blood test confirmed
a diabetic emergency.

65
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:11,793
So, he's currently in a coma.

66
00:04:11,876 --> 00:04:16,172
We're closely monitoring oxygen saturation

67
00:04:16,256 --> 00:04:18,841
and sensorium post-operation.

68
00:04:18,925 --> 00:04:19,842
Um…

69
00:04:19,926 --> 00:04:23,596
But we need to replenish the blood
and correct sugars.

70
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:26,557
We won't know the full extent

71
00:04:26,641 --> 00:04:29,185
of the neurological damage
to Oliver's brain

72
00:04:29,269 --> 00:04:30,770
until he wakes up.

73
00:04:30,853 --> 00:04:32,105
I'm sorry.

74
00:04:32,188 --> 00:04:34,023
I'll keep you updated.

75
00:04:35,275 --> 00:04:41,864
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

76
00:04:53,751 --> 00:04:54,961
[GROANS]

77
00:04:56,212 --> 00:04:57,505
[CRYING]

78
00:04:57,588 --> 00:04:58,756
<i>Ma.</i>

79
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:01,551
[YOUNG BILLY CRYING]

80
00:05:01,634 --> 00:05:03,094
<i>- Ma!</i>
<i>- You're not allowed here, dear.</i>

81
00:05:03,177 --> 00:05:06,472
<i>Ma! Ma!</i>

82
00:05:06,556 --> 00:05:08,349
- [DOCTOR] <i>Ma'am?</i>
- [YOUNG BILLY WAILING] <i>Ma!</i>

83
00:05:08,433 --> 00:05:11,352
- [DOCTOR] <i>Time of death…</i>
<i>- Ma!</i>

84
00:05:11,436 --> 00:05:17,317
[MOROSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

85
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:23,197
[BREATHING HEAVILY]

86
00:05:23,281 --> 00:05:30,288
[SOBBING]

87
00:05:32,290 --> 00:05:38,421
- [MOROSE MUSIC CONTINUES]
- [BILLY CRYING]

88
00:05:42,050 --> 00:05:43,301
Auntie…

89
00:05:43,384 --> 00:05:46,179
Oliver…

90
00:05:46,262 --> 00:05:52,560
- [MOROSE MUSIC CONTINUES]
- [CRYING]

91
00:05:58,316 --> 00:06:00,401
[BREATHING HEAVILY]

92
00:06:00,485 --> 00:06:01,527
Auntie.

93
00:06:04,072 --> 00:06:08,951
[ENRICO PANTING]

94
00:06:09,035 --> 00:06:12,830
- [GLOOMY MUSIC PLAYING]
- [ECG MACHINE BEEPING]

95
00:06:12,914 --> 00:06:14,082
Dear…

96
00:06:14,165 --> 00:06:18,753
- [GLOOMY MUSIC CONTINUES]
- [ECG MACHINE BEEPING]

97
00:06:18,836 --> 00:06:21,964
If you hadn't believed Bea

98
00:06:22,757 --> 00:06:26,469
and convinced me to patch
things up with her,

99
00:06:27,804 --> 00:06:30,098
Mariela wouldn't have escaped,

100
00:06:31,641 --> 00:06:33,476
and we wouldn't be here.

101
00:06:37,814 --> 00:06:40,817
My brother wouldn't have gotten hurt.

102
00:06:43,111 --> 00:06:44,654
I admit it.

103
00:06:44,737 --> 00:06:47,115
This is all my fault.

104
00:06:48,324 --> 00:06:49,742
I'm sorry, dear.

105
00:06:51,202 --> 00:06:52,787
I'm sorry, Oliver.

106
00:06:55,665 --> 00:06:56,874
[ENRICO SIGHS]

107
00:06:58,543 --> 00:07:01,087
I should've been the one
who got stabbed by Mariela.

108
00:07:03,297 --> 00:07:05,758
I should've been the one who got hurt!

109
00:07:05,842 --> 00:07:10,513
[ENRICO SOBBING SOFTLY]

110
00:07:17,562 --> 00:07:18,896
[BEA] How are you doing, Ma?

111
00:07:19,856 --> 00:07:21,357
Remember what I told you?

112
00:07:22,483 --> 00:07:25,403
You shouldn't neglect yourself here.

113
00:07:28,072 --> 00:07:30,324
I can no longer be by your side, Ma.

114
00:07:31,951 --> 00:07:34,495
So don't do anything
that can harm you, okay?

115
00:07:35,580 --> 00:07:38,207
Always take care of yourself.

116
00:07:39,667 --> 00:07:43,629
[POIGNANT MUSIC PLAYING]

117
00:07:43,713 --> 00:07:45,047
I'm sorry.

118
00:07:46,382 --> 00:07:48,843
I'm sorry for what I did to Caloy.

119
00:07:50,887 --> 00:07:54,724
I know that you loved him too.

120
00:08:02,899 --> 00:08:04,901
Caloy loved me so much, Ma.

121
00:08:06,444 --> 00:08:07,570
So much.

122
00:08:09,614 --> 00:08:10,740
He really…

123
00:08:15,161 --> 00:08:17,997
He really would do anything
just to make me happy.

124
00:08:21,709 --> 00:08:25,379
That's why I'm the only one to
blame for what happened.

125
00:08:27,298 --> 00:08:28,799
That was on me, Ma.

126
00:08:28,883 --> 00:08:34,222
[POIGNANT MUSIC CONTINUES]

127
00:08:34,305 --> 00:08:37,433
I've done so many terrible things to you.

128
00:08:40,561 --> 00:08:42,271
But despite everything,

129
00:08:43,898 --> 00:08:45,942
you're still here for me.

130
00:08:48,069 --> 00:08:50,112
[INHALES DEEPLY]

131
00:08:51,531 --> 00:08:54,158
How is the boy doing?

132
00:08:59,622 --> 00:09:00,957
[SNIFFLES]

133
00:09:02,250 --> 00:09:05,336
Oliver is still in the hospital.

134
00:09:06,128 --> 00:09:07,838
He's not out of the woods yet.

135
00:09:11,175 --> 00:09:13,594
And your father?

136
00:09:16,764 --> 00:09:18,140
[SNIFFLES]

137
00:09:18,224 --> 00:09:20,226
Papa is fine now.

138
00:09:21,269 --> 00:09:23,688
[SIGHS DEEPLY]

139
00:09:25,022 --> 00:09:26,232
Ma…

140
00:09:28,484 --> 00:09:30,403
Don't worry about it.

141
00:09:30,486 --> 00:09:34,532
I'll apologize to them, okay?

142
00:09:34,615 --> 00:09:36,158
Don't worry about--

143
00:09:40,329 --> 00:09:41,455
Dear…

144
00:09:42,456 --> 00:09:44,875
I really didn't mean for that to happen.

145
00:09:46,002 --> 00:09:47,461
Does your wound still hurt?

146
00:09:49,005 --> 00:09:50,089
I'm fine.

147
00:09:50,715 --> 00:09:52,258
My wound is healing well.

148
00:09:54,343 --> 00:09:55,511
I'm sorry, dear.

149
00:09:56,762 --> 00:10:00,224
I've caused you so much pain.

150
00:10:00,308 --> 00:10:06,439
[POIGNANT MUSIC CONTINUES]

151
00:10:09,692 --> 00:10:10,651
Ma…

152
00:10:13,195 --> 00:10:14,447
Just forget it.

153
00:10:17,283 --> 00:10:18,743
I'm okay now.

154
00:10:20,661 --> 00:10:22,371
All I want…

155
00:10:24,915 --> 00:10:27,126
is for you to be okay too.

156
00:10:28,753 --> 00:10:31,047
That's all I want, okay?

157
00:10:33,633 --> 00:10:35,968
You know, since you were a kid,

158
00:10:37,011 --> 00:10:38,596
you've always been like this.

159
00:10:40,306 --> 00:10:42,475
You always put me first.

160
00:10:43,559 --> 00:10:46,062
You're always taking care of me.

161
00:10:48,314 --> 00:10:50,691
[SOBS] That shouldn't have been the case.

162
00:10:51,859 --> 00:10:53,986
[SNIFFLES] I'm your mother.

163
00:10:54,070 --> 00:10:56,739
I should be the one taking care of you.

164
00:10:57,823 --> 00:11:04,330
- [MARIELA SNIFFLING, SOBBING]
- [POIGNANT MUSIC CONTINUES]

165
00:11:04,413 --> 00:11:07,500
But all I did…
[SNIFFLES]

166
00:11:09,293 --> 00:11:10,920
…was look down on you.

167
00:11:11,712 --> 00:11:14,173
<i>Call your sister. Let's eat.</i>

168
00:11:18,719 --> 00:11:21,972
<i>Ma, why are there only three plates?</i>

169
00:11:23,682 --> 00:11:26,352
<i>I told you to call your sister.</i>

170
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:29,855
<i>Did you know she got promoted?</i>

171
00:11:31,107 --> 00:11:34,527
<i>Your sister is really amazing.</i>

172
00:11:34,610 --> 00:11:37,071
<i>She's so smart.</i>

173
00:11:39,782 --> 00:11:41,325
<i>Oh come on, Ma.</i>

174
00:11:41,409 --> 00:11:43,494
<i>I was just asking why</i>
<i>there were only three plates,</i>

175
00:11:43,577 --> 00:11:46,247
<i>and you keep blabbing about Abi.</i>

176
00:11:46,330 --> 00:11:48,249
<i>So why are there only three plates?</i>

177
00:11:48,332 --> 00:11:51,419
<i>Is Papa not coming home?</i>
<i>Isn't he joining us?</i>

178
00:11:51,502 --> 00:11:54,547
<i>You are so dumb, aren't you?</i>

179
00:11:54,630 --> 00:11:57,258
<i>You're stupid!</i>

180
00:11:58,509 --> 00:12:00,302
<i>You really take after your father.</i>

181
00:12:00,386 --> 00:12:02,388
<i>You're both useless!</i>

182
00:12:03,222 --> 00:12:04,557
<i>So, what?</i>

183
00:12:05,808 --> 00:12:08,310
<i>Are you going to take his side? Huh?</i>

184
00:12:08,394 --> 00:12:11,939
<i>Then get out of here and go with him!</i>

185
00:12:12,022 --> 00:12:15,860
<i>You deserve each other anyway!</i>

186
00:12:16,777 --> 00:12:21,073
I kept comparing you to your sister.

187
00:12:24,076 --> 00:12:25,995
But the truth is,

188
00:12:27,204 --> 00:12:30,249
between the two of you,
you're much stronger.

189
00:12:31,792 --> 00:12:33,419
[MARIELA SNIFFLES]

190
00:12:33,502 --> 00:12:37,715
Your sister decided to work in Manila…

191
00:12:39,592 --> 00:12:41,343
to get away from me.

192
00:12:43,137 --> 00:12:45,514
[LAUGHS WRYLY]

193
00:12:45,598 --> 00:12:48,767
Because I'm difficult to love.

194
00:12:54,356 --> 00:12:55,941
Forgive me, dear.

195
00:12:59,612 --> 00:13:04,116
I was blinded by my love for your father.

196
00:13:06,452 --> 00:13:08,704
And when he hurt us,

197
00:13:10,331 --> 00:13:12,333
I was overcome by anger.

198
00:13:13,042 --> 00:13:14,168
[MARIELA SNIFFLES]

199
00:13:14,835 --> 00:13:18,714
Because of that, I failed you as a mother.

200
00:13:22,384 --> 00:13:26,805
I let you suffer because of my resentment.

201
00:13:32,937 --> 00:13:35,981
I want to own up to my mistakes

202
00:13:37,107 --> 00:13:39,068
and all the crimes I committed.

203
00:13:41,111 --> 00:13:44,990
I know they'll transfer me to
a correctional facility soon.

204
00:13:47,201 --> 00:13:49,745
But it should just be me.

205
00:13:49,828 --> 00:13:52,373
I should be the only one
in prison, not you.

206
00:13:52,456 --> 00:13:53,415
[SNIFFLES]

207
00:13:53,499 --> 00:13:57,169
[POIGNANT MUSIC CONTINUES]

208
00:13:57,253 --> 00:14:01,131
[MARIELA] I'm sorry, dear.
I wasn't a good mother to you.

209
00:14:03,050 --> 00:14:04,760
But do everything you can

210
00:14:04,843 --> 00:14:07,429
to make sure you don't end up like me

211
00:14:07,513 --> 00:14:11,141
or in the same situation I'm in.

212
00:14:15,271 --> 00:14:16,272
[SNIFFLES]

213
00:14:18,566 --> 00:14:20,901
The least I can do for you now…

214
00:14:25,155 --> 00:14:27,449
is support you as you fight.

215
00:14:30,953 --> 00:14:33,122
Not to get revenge,

216
00:14:34,665 --> 00:14:37,001
but to fight for your future.

217
00:14:37,084 --> 00:14:43,632
[POIGNANT MUSIC CONTINUES]

218
00:14:43,716 --> 00:14:46,051
It's not too late, is it, Ma?

219
00:14:48,470 --> 00:14:49,805
We still have…

220
00:14:50,973 --> 00:14:53,976
We still have many days, many months,

221
00:14:54,059 --> 00:14:56,896
and many chances to change.

222
00:15:01,233 --> 00:15:03,444
I'll never get out of here.

223
00:15:05,404 --> 00:15:06,780
And I've accepted that.

224
00:15:08,449 --> 00:15:10,701
I'll turn my life around
while I'm in here.

225
00:15:13,495 --> 00:15:17,833
[EMOTIONAL MUSIC PLAYING]

226
00:15:17,917 --> 00:15:19,168
[BEA SOBS]

227
00:15:23,422 --> 00:15:25,633
If that happens, Ma…

228
00:15:30,054 --> 00:15:35,100
I'll visit you every day.

229
00:15:35,184 --> 00:15:36,310
[SNIFFLES]

230
00:15:37,436 --> 00:15:40,022
Don't worry about me anymore.

231
00:15:41,482 --> 00:15:43,984
Focus on yourself.

232
00:15:46,612 --> 00:15:50,407
Get back on your feet
and turn your life around.

233
00:15:51,867 --> 00:15:55,871
I want you to be happy. Okay?

234
00:15:57,081 --> 00:15:59,249
And I want to see you get back up.

235
00:16:02,211 --> 00:16:03,587
[CHUCKLES SOFTLY]

236
00:16:03,671 --> 00:16:10,636
[MUSIC TURNS DRAMATIC]

237
00:16:21,730 --> 00:16:24,566
[ECG MONITOR BEEPING]

238
00:16:28,278 --> 00:16:34,284
[MOROSE MUSIC PLAYING]

239
00:16:55,806 --> 00:16:56,974
How is he?

240
00:17:01,603 --> 00:17:02,688
How is he?

241
00:17:02,771 --> 00:17:07,818
[MOROSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

242
00:17:07,901 --> 00:17:08,861
Look at him.

243
00:17:09,653 --> 00:17:13,782
[MUSIC TURNS TENSE]

244
00:17:13,866 --> 00:17:16,285
I said look at him! Go on, look!

245
00:17:17,036 --> 00:17:18,620
What do you think?!

246
00:17:21,665 --> 00:17:24,543
Billy, believe me.
I never meant for Oliver to get hurt--

247
00:17:24,626 --> 00:17:26,420
Well, he did!

248
00:17:26,503 --> 00:17:30,132
He had nothing to do with this,
but you and your mom dragged him into it!

249
00:17:30,966 --> 00:17:33,343
I admit that it's my fault.

250
00:17:35,637 --> 00:17:37,347
I'm really sorry, Billy.

251
00:17:37,973 --> 00:17:39,475
- I'm sorry--
- Don't touch me!

252
00:17:39,558 --> 00:17:41,602
- Billy, please--
- Don't touch me! Just leave!

253
00:17:42,186 --> 00:17:46,273
I said leave! Get out of here!

254
00:17:46,356 --> 00:17:51,987
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

255
00:17:56,116 --> 00:18:00,496
[BREATHING HEAVILY]

256
00:18:12,925 --> 00:18:19,515
[TENSE MUSIC SWELLS]

257
00:18:21,558 --> 00:18:23,894
<i>I didn't hear the news right away.</i>

258
00:18:25,646 --> 00:18:27,689
<i>Dude, otherwise, I would've been here.</i>

259
00:18:28,273 --> 00:18:30,234
<i>I would've dropped everything.</i>

260
00:18:31,944 --> 00:18:33,821
<i>I heard you paid part of the bill?</i>

261
00:18:35,155 --> 00:18:36,240
<i>Yeah.</i>

262
00:18:36,865 --> 00:18:38,492
<i>It's the least I could do for Oliver.</i>

263
00:18:38,575 --> 00:18:40,119
<i>You didn't have to do that.</i>

264
00:18:42,162 --> 00:18:45,707
<i>Billy, I just wanted to help.</i>

265
00:18:46,667 --> 00:18:47,960
<i>That's what we do, right?</i>

266
00:18:48,460 --> 00:18:51,213
<i>We help each other out</i>
<i>when things get tough.</i>

267
00:18:52,506 --> 00:18:54,216
<i>Do you remember</i>

268
00:18:55,134 --> 00:18:58,011
<i>when the bar was struggling,</i>
<i>and we almost had to close?</i>

269
00:18:58,762 --> 00:19:01,932
<i>You covered our expenses</i>
<i>just so we could survive.</i>

270
00:19:02,015 --> 00:19:06,854
<i>You even covered</i>
<i>Grandpa Jude's care facility bills</i>

271
00:19:08,105 --> 00:19:09,523
<i>until I got back on my feet.</i>

272
00:19:10,274 --> 00:19:11,650
<i>I'll pay you back.</i>

273
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:15,696
<i>Dude, family doesn't keep score.</i>

274
00:19:27,624 --> 00:19:29,918
<i>Why did you bring that woman here?</i>

275
00:19:30,669 --> 00:19:32,504
<i>She wanted to visit Oliver.</i>

276
00:19:32,588 --> 00:19:34,131
<i>But Billy was here,</i>

277
00:19:34,715 --> 00:19:36,884
<i>so I just sent her home</i>
<i>to avoid any trouble.</i>

278
00:19:36,967 --> 00:19:39,052
<i>Of course there'd be trouble.</i>

279
00:19:39,136 --> 00:19:40,929
<i>You shouldn't have brought her here.</i>

280
00:19:41,013 --> 00:19:44,057
<i>She wanted to apologize to Billy</i>
<i>and get her forgiveness.</i>

281
00:19:44,975 --> 00:19:46,768
<i>You know that's impossible.</i>

282
00:19:47,895 --> 00:19:50,898
<i>She tried to save Oliver.</i>

283
00:19:50,981 --> 00:19:53,483
<i>She even got stabbed</i>
<i>herself, remember?</i>

284
00:19:53,567 --> 00:19:55,068
<i>Precious…</i>

285
00:19:55,736 --> 00:19:57,613
<i>Bea's changed.</i>

286
00:19:58,447 --> 00:20:00,365
<i>I'm sure of that.</i>

287
00:20:00,449 --> 00:20:02,618
<i>Well, it's too late.</i>

288
00:20:03,243 --> 00:20:05,621
<i>Billy won't forgive her again.</i>

289
00:20:06,205 --> 00:20:08,415
<i>She wants to put Bea back in prison.</i>

290
00:20:08,498 --> 00:20:10,417
<i>I've told you before, right?</i>

291
00:20:12,085 --> 00:20:14,254
<i>I was going to have a sibling</i>
<i>at one point.</i>

292
00:20:16,340 --> 00:20:17,716
<i>But Mom had a miscarriage</i>

293
00:20:19,134 --> 00:20:20,761
<i>because Dad beat her.</i>
